<title>JAPAN: Toyota buys back 3.6 mln of its shares.</title>
<headline>Toyota buys back 3.6 mln of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Thursday it had bought back 3.612 million of its own shares on the Tokyo Stock Exchange between August 28 and September 25.</p>
<p>The value of the repurchases totalled 9.551 billion yen.</p>
<p>The move followed a Toyota shareholders' meeting on June 26, when shareholders agreed to the firm's plan to buy back up to 100 billion yen worth of its 43 million shares, it said.</p>
<p>As of September 25, the cumulative amount of its repurchases totalled 11.319 million shares, worth about 30 billion yen, it said.</p>
<p>Toyota gained 30 yen to close at 2,810 yen on Thursday.</p>
